      "id": "o-33-33-ff-12-34",
      "text": "33:33:ff:12:34:56.",
      "explanation": "33:33 seguido de los últimos 32 bits (ff:12:34:56) da 33:33:ff:12:34:56."
    },
    {
      "id": "o-33-33-00-12-34",
      "text": "33:33:00:12:34:56.",
      "explanation": "Sustituye el octeto ff de los 32 bits finales por 00."
